  "legalTitle": "Legal notice",
  "legalPublisherHeading": "Publisher and publication director",
  "legalPublisherBody": "NUNI is published by Bruno Chappe, a private individual, on a non-professional and free basis. Publication director: Bruno Chappe. Contact: bruno.chappe@gmail.com.",
  "legalHostingHeading": "Website hosting",
  "legalHostingBody": "Vercel Inc., 440 N Barranca Ave #4133, Covina, CA 91723, United States (vercel.com).",
  "legalDataHostingHeading": "Data hosting",
  "legalDataHostingBody": "Supabase Pte. Ltd., 65 Chulia Street #38-02/03, OCBC Centre, Singapore 049513 (supabase.com). The database and photos are stored in the European Union (West EU region, Paris).",
  "legalCreditsHeading": "Credits",
  "legalCreditsBody": "NUNI relies on these services, data and open-source software: thanks to their authors. Tap a row to open its page.",
  "legalCreditsMapsData": "Maps and data",
  "legalCreditsFontsIcons": "Font and icons",
  "legalCreditsLibraries": "Libraries",
  "legalCreditsAllLicenses": "View all licences",
  "mapAttributionOsm": "OpenStreetMap contributors",

  "privacyTitle": "Privacy",
  "privacyControllerHeading": "Data controller",
  "privacyControllerBody": "Bruno Chappe, publisher of NUNI (see the legal notice). Contact: bruno.chappe@gmail.com.",
  "privacyDataHeading": "Data we process",
  "privacyDataBody": "Your Google identity (email, name, picture) and, if you upload one, your profile photo; the players, sessions, holes and strokes you take part in; your GPS position at the moment you create a session or a hole, or show nearby holes (never tracked continuously); photos you choose to upload; your club; if you ask to create a club or to be its local manager: your email, phone and message, visible only to you and the administrators.",
  "privacyPurposeHeading": "Why, and on what basis",
  "privacyPurposeBody": "Only to run collaborative scoring: sharing sessions, computing rankings and the championship, showing holes near you. Legal basis: performing the service you ask for by creating your account. Your position is only read with your permission, which you can withdraw at any time in your browser or phone settings.",
  "privacyRecipientsHeading": "Who sees or receives your data",
  "privacyRecipientsBody": "Your public profile is visible to every signed-in user, notably from sessions and each club's page: it shows your display name, your photo and your statistics. The statistics are computed from your completed sessions; for that, the history of those sessions (teams, holes and scores, without comments or photos) is readable by every signed-in user. The “Public statistics” switch in your profile removes them from your public profile, without hiding those sessions and scores: anyone could redo the calculations. Once started, a session and its scores are visible to its players and to every member of the club it was created in; public holes, clubs and their local manager's name are visible to every user. Technical providers: Supabase (database and photos), Vercel (website hosting), Google (sign-in). Services called with an approximate position, without your identity: BigDataCloud (city name), Open-Meteo (session weather), OpenStreetMap (map tiles). No data is sold or shared for any other purpose.",
  "privacyTransfersHeading": "Transfers outside the European Union",
  "privacyTransfersBody": "Vercel and Google are based in the United States, Supabase in Singapore. These transfers are covered by the European Commission's standard contractual clauses (Vercel, Supabase) and the EU–U.S. Data Privacy Framework (Google).",
  "privacyRetentionHeading": "How long",
  "privacyRetentionBody": "As long as your account exists. Shared sessions and scores remain visible to the other players of those sessions.",
  "privacyLegacyHeading": "Players from the former LsgScores app",
  "privacyLegacyBody": "Sessions from the former LsgScores app were brought into NUNI with the players' names and, so that you get your history back when you first sign in, your email address. That address is visible to no one in the app and is erased as soon as you sign in. You can object to this by writing to bruno.chappe@gmail.com.",
  "privacyRightsHeading": "Your rights",
  "privacyRightsBody": "You can ask to access, correct, erase or export your data, to restrict its processing, or object to it, by writing to bruno.chappe@gmail.com (answer within one month). In-app account deletion is planned but not built yet. If you believe your rights are not respected, you can lodge a complaint with the CNIL, the French data protection authority (cnil.fr).",
  "privacyTrackingHeading": "No tracking",
  "privacyTrackingBody": "No analytics, no advertising, no trackers. Your browser keeps your sign-in, language and colours locally; none of it is used to follow you.",
  "privacyUpdatedHeading": "Last updated",
  "privacyUpdatedBody": "24 September 2026.",

